    <h1 class="page-title">{page.h1}</h1>
    <div class="entry-content" set:html={`<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-x-large-font-size"><strong>연락하다</strong></h2><div class="wp-block-image"><figure class="aligncenter is-resized"><img src="/images/company-building-1-1024x598.jpg" decoding="async" width="1024" height="598" alt="Company Building" class="wp-image-209" style="width:575px;height:auto" title="연락하다건물" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption"><strong>헤드 오피스 빌딩</strong>: #3 건물, 노스 실리콘 밸리, 차오둥구, 장자커우시, 헤베이, 중국.</figcaption></figure></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>연락 할 전문가</strong></h2></div></div><div style="height:27px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>마틴</strong></p><hr class="wp-block-separator alignwide has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><p class="has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph"><strong>주소:</strong> #3 건물, 노스 실리콘 밸리, 차오둥구, 장자커우시, 헤베이, 중국.</p><p class="has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph"><strong>핸드폰 | 왓츠앱 | 위챗:</strong> +86 13323237275</p><p class="has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph" style="text-transform:none"><strong>이메일: </strong><a href="mailto:martin@dinweys.com">martin@dinweys.com</a></p><div style="height:112px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>아론</strong>.<strong>왕</strong></p><hr class="wp-block-separator alignwide has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><p class="has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph"><strong>핸드폰 | 왓츠앱 | 위챗:</strong> +86 13313137465</p><p class="has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph" style="text-transform:none"><strong>이메일: </strong><a href="mailto:aaron@dinweys.com">aaron@dinweys.com</a></p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>`} />
